  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday Night through next Saturday)\nIssued at 1054 AM CDT Sat Oct 3 2026\n\nA reinforcing cold front will swing through on Monday, giving us \ncrisp, fall-like temperatures. Highs for the work week will \ninitially be in the 70s, but slowly warm back into the mid 80s as\nthe week wears on. The morning lows are where the chilly air \nreally shines, as temperatures will dip into the 40s and 50s \nacross the area through mid-week next week. The week looks dry as \nwell, until we get into the weekend when it looks like another \nshot of rain. Hopefully, we can get enough to help bust more of \nthis drought.",
